      "text": "Faculty Roster The Divisions of Genomics & Precision Medicine and Biomedical Informatics merged on October 1, 2026. You can browse our comprehensive list of faculty below. Core Faculty Lisa Madlensky, PhD, CGC Interim Division Chief Professor of Medicine Provider Page Tiffany Amariuta, PhD Assistant Professor Aaron Boussina, PhD Assistant Adjunct Professor Hannah Carter, PhD Professor Carter Lab Kathleen (Kit) Curtius, PhD Associate Professor Curtius Lab Robert El-Kareh, MD, MS, MPH Clinical Professor Alon Goren, PhD Associate Professor Goren Lab Michael Hogarth, MD Professor Trey Ideker, PhD Professor Ideker Lab Jejo David Koola, MD, MS Associate Clinical Professor Robert Naviaux, MD, PhD Professor In Residence Naviaux Lab Shamim Nemati, PhD Associate Professor Nemati Lab Karandeep Singh, MD, MMSc Associate Professor Amy Sitapati, MD Professor Sitapati Lab Pablo Tamayo, PhD Professor Tamayo Lab Timothy Wen, MD, MPH Assistant Professor Clinical Profile Affiliate Faculty Lukas Chavez, PhD Associate Adjunct Professor, NS Chavez Lab Don Cleveland, PhD Distinguished Professor Cleveland Lab Melissa Gymrek, PhD Adjunct Professor Gymrek Lab Bruce Hamilton Adjunct Professor, NS Hamilton Lab Committee for Collaboration and Outreach The mission of the Committee for Collaboration and Outreach is to further the scientific research activities of the Division of Medical Genetics internally, through enabling collaborations, and externally, by communicating research activities and results.",
